# The commands nothing else runs.
#
# An audit of /help against every plan found twelve commands no scenario ever
# executed -- including /next and /suggest, which Arturo prints at the operator
# the moment an Enterprise is created and the moment a Function is staffed. The
# two commands a newcomer is most likely to type first were the two nothing
# proved.
#
# This plan exists to run them, not to demonstrate a business. It is not a
# blueprint and is not for filming.
#
# /start, /workflow and /run are deliberately absent: they moved to /help all
# rather than be given coverage they had not earned.
/reset
yes
/clear
@timeout 300
@note the reference lookups, which need nothing set up
/archetypes
/capabilities
/enterprise
Halden Joinery
Make and fit bespoke kitchen joinery.
q
@note /next: what Arturo tells you to run the moment an Enterprise exists
@next /next
/functions
@note a Function of our own, so the rest does not depend on what the model proposed
/function
1
Quote Preparation
Turn a customer enquiry into a priced quote a joiner can build from.
@blank
@staff /staff
@note /add-ai-worker by hand: a name, then a role by number
/add-ai-worker
Quote Estimator
